CHAPTER.VERS:
How long will you

          {+}
         set on a man, That you

          {+}
         may slay [him], all of you

          {+}
         Like a leaning wall, like a tottering fence?

Trust in him at all times, you

          {+}
         people; Pour out your

          {+}
         heart before him: God is a refuge for us. Selah.

Don't trust in oppression, And don't become vain in robbery: If riches increase, don't set your

          {+}
         heart [on them].
